<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to Skoob Invoice</title>

    ```
    <style>
      /* Base Styles */
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family:
          -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica,
          Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f8f9fb;
        color: #2c3e50;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      a {
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #f8f9fb;
        table-layout: fixed;
        padding: 40px 0;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 580px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 16px;
        border: 1px solid #eaeef2;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      /* Header */
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #172554 100%);
        color: #ffffff;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 42px 24px 38px;
        border-bottom: 3px solid #c5a059;
      }

      .brand {
        margin: 0 0 24px;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #dbeafe;
      }

      .success-icon {
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        margin: 0 auto 22px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        line-height: 64px;
        font-size: 30px;
      }

      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 28px;
        line-height: 1.3;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      }

      .header-subtitle {
        margin: 10px 0 0;
        color: #dbeafe;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      /* Body */
      .body {
        padding: 42px 36px 36px;
      }

      .body p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.75;
        color: #4a5568;
        margin: 0 0 20px;
      }

      .body p.greeting {
        font-size: 18px;
        color: #1a202c;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .body strong {
        color: #1e293b;
      }

      /* Welcome Message */
      .welcome-box {
        margin: 28px 0;
        padding: 22px 24px;
        background-color: #f8fafc;
        border: 1px solid #e8edf3;
        border-left: 4px solid #c5a059;
        border-radius: 10px;
      }

      .welcome-box p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #64748b;
      }

      /* Features */
      .features {
        margin: 30px 0;
      }

      .feature {
        display: table;
        width: 100%;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .feature-icon {
        display: table-cell;
        width: 40px;
        vertical-align: top;
        padding-top: 2px;
      }

      .feature-icon span {
        display: inline-block;
        width: 30px;
        height: 30px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background-color: #eff6ff;
        color: #1e3a8a;
        text-align: center;
        line-height: 30px;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .feature-content {
        display: table-cell;
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      .feature-title {
        margin: 0 0 3px;
        color: #1e293b;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .feature-description {
        margin: 0;
        color: #718096;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      /* Button */
      .button-container {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 34px 0 30px;
      }

      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #172554 100%);
        color: #ffffff !important;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        padding: 16px 38px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(11, 19, 43, 0.15);
      }

      /* Divider */
      .divider {
        height: 1px;
        background-color: #edf2f7;
        margin: 30px 0;
      }

      .closing {
        font-size: 14px !important;
        color: #718096 !important;
        margin-bottom: 0 !important;
      }

      /* Footer */
      .footer {
        background-color: #fcfcfd;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 13px;
        padding: 28px 24px;
        color: #718096;
        border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7;
      }

      .footer p {
        margin: 6px 0;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .footer a {
        color: #0b132b;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      .copyright {
        color: #cbd5e0 !important;
        margin-top: 12px !important;
      }

      /* Responsive */
      @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
        .wrapper {
          padding: 10px;
        }

        .container {
          border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .header {
          padding: 34px 20px 32px;
        }

        .header h1 {
          font-size: 24px;
        }

        .body {
          padding: 30px 20px;
        }

        .welcome-box {
          padding: 18px;
        }

        .button {
          padding: 15px 30px;
        }
      }
    </style>
    ```
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="container">
        ```
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
          <p class="brand">Skoob Invoice</p>

          <div class="success-icon">✓</div>

          <h1>Welcome aboard, <%= user.name %>!</h1>

          <p class="header-subtitle">
            Your account has been successfully verified.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Body -->
        <div class="body">
          <p class="greeting">Hello <strong><%= user.name %></strong>,</p>

          <p>
            Your email has been verified and your
            <strong>Skoob Invoice</strong> account is officially ready. We're
            excited to have you here.
          </p>

          <div class="welcome-box">
            <p>
              Skoob Invoice is built to make invoicing feel less like paperwork
              and more like progress — helping you create, manage, track, and
              get paid for your invoices with confidence.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Features -->
          <div class="features">
            <div class="feature">
              <div class="feature-icon">
                <span>✓</span>
              </div>

              <div class="feature-content">
                <p class="feature-title">Create professional invoices</p>

                <p class="feature-description">
                  Create polished invoices that represent your business
                  professionally.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="feature">
              <div class="feature-icon">
                <span>₦</span>
              </div>

              <div class="feature-content">
                <p class="feature-title">Track payments with ease</p>

                <p class="feature-description">
                  Keep an eye on paid, pending, overdue, and partially paid
                  invoices from one place.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="feature">
              <div class="feature-icon">
                <span>↗</span>
              </div>

              <div class="feature-content">
                <p class="feature-title">Stay on top of your business</p>

                <p class="feature-description">
                  Spend less time managing paperwork and more time growing your
                  business.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- CTA -->
          <div class="button-container">
            <a href="<%= siteUrl %>" class="button"> Visit Skoob Invoice </a>
          </div>

          <div class="divider"></div>

          <p class="closing">
            Here's to simpler invoices, faster payments, and more time for what
            matters.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
          <p>
            Need assistance? Contact our concierge team at
            <a href="mailto:support@skoob.com"> support@skoob.com </a>
          </p>

          <p class="copyright">
            &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Skoob Invoice. All rights
            reserved.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    ```
  </body>
</html>
